      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The prompt should be collapsed and display in the deferred/paused state. A shorter bottom sheet with a down arrow button is shown in place of the full prompt, and biometric sensors are not activated. Apps can call resumeAuthentication() when ready to expand the bottom sheet to the full prompt and activate biometric sensors to begin authenticating.</para>
